---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---
<Base title="推广指南" titleEn="Sharing guide">
  <section class="container public-inner-hero guide-hero" aria-labelledby="promote-heading">
    <div class="public-hero-copy">
      <div class="public-kicker"><span class="public-kicker-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span><span data-zh="分享工具">SHARING TOOLKIT</span></div>
      <h1 id="promote-heading" data-zh="分享你真正用得上的工具。">Share a tool worth using.</h1>
      <p class="lead" data-zh="分享 x-Reply-Helper 的实际使用体验。你可在账户中使用已开放的邀请功能，复制自己的邀请链接和推广文案。">Share your experience with x-Reply-Helper. Use the existing invitation feature in your account, when available, to copy your invite link and share text.</p>
      <div class="guide-actions">
        <a class="button" href="/account/"><span data-zh="前往我的账户">Go to my account</span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        <a class="button secondary" href="/guide/"><span data-zh="查看产品使用指南">Read the product guide</span></a>
      </div>
      <p class="public-hero-fineprint" data-zh="此页仅提供分享素材，不代表获得推广合作资格，也不承诺现金收益。">This page provides sharing materials only. It does not grant partner status or promise cash earnings.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="container public-content-section" aria-labelledby="promote-tips">
    <div class="public-section-header"><div><div class="eyebrow" data-zh="分享建议">SHARING TIPS</div><h2 id="promote-tips" data-zh="从真实体验出发">Start with real experience</h2></div></div>
    <div class="grid-3 public-step-grid">
      <article class="feature-card public-step-card"><span class="step-number">01</span><h3 data-zh="展示你的使用场景">Show how you use it</h3><p data-zh="分享一段实际的回复草稿和你最后采用的表达。发送始终由你决定。">Show a real reply draft and the wording you chose. You always decide whether to send.</p></article>
      <article class="feature-card public-step-card"><span class="step-number">02</span><h3 data-zh="使用自己的邀请链接">Use your own invite link</h3><p data-zh="如果账户已开放邀请功能，复制页面提供的链接和文案。不要替换其他人的邀请码。">If invitations are available in your account, copy the link and share text provided there. Do not substitute another person's code.</p></article>
      <article class="feature-card public-step-card"><span class="step-number">03</span><h3 data-zh="真实表达，不夸大承诺">Keep your claims accurate</h3><p data-zh="不要承诺粉丝增长、收益或平台认可；分享时说明实际体验及邀请关系。">Do not promise follower growth, income or platform endorsement. Describe your actual experience and disclose the referral relationship.</p></article>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
